<title>HONG KONG: Shinhan Bank sets $150 mln sub bond.</title>
<headline>Shinhan Bank sets $150 mln sub bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Euro 144a issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>BORROWER SHINHAN BANK</p>
<p> AMT     US$150 MLN    COUPON     7.25 PCT  MATURITY  26.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE    SUB BONDS     ISS PRICE  99.926*   PAY DATE  26.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY    A3	REOFFER    99.926*   LAUNCH    20.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P	A-	SPREAD     +100BP**  DENOMS    US$1,000</p>
<p> LISTING	 LONDON  PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p> PUTS	    NONE    CALLS	NONE	LIMITS    --</p>
<p> NEG PLG	 NONE    CRS DEF    NONE	FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> FULL FEES     --	MGT/UND    --	  SELL CONC --</p>
<p> GOV LAW	 ENGLISH HOME	 S.KOREA</p>
<p>LEAD MANAGERS MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO (BOOKS)</p>
<p> CO-MANAGERS   SBC WARBURG</p>
<p> NOTES     *PRICED TO YIELD 7.268 PCT</p>
<p>	    **SPREAD IS OVER U.S. TREASURY 6.5 PCT DUE 2002</p>
<p>	   ***ISSUED FROM GLOBAL MTN PROGRAMME DATED JUNE 13, 1997</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4043.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
